*> Entity models part 9, sections 5 and 6 (docs/protocol/34-entity-models-9-non-living-entities.md): the trident, the riptide spin-attack effect and the wind charge.
*>   EF9-M-TRIDENT (5.1, texture 32 x 32), EF9-M-SPIN-ATTACK (5.3, texture 64 x 64), EF9-M-WIND-CHARGE (6.1, texture 64 x 32) USING model;
*>   EF9-TRIDENT-OPS IN(1 yRot deg, 2 xRot deg) OUT(ops: count, then code and three values per op; 1 translate, 2 scale, 3 rotate Y, 5 rotate X, 7 rotate Z): 5.2 submit
*>     (rotate Y by yRot - 90, rotate Z by xRot + 90; no flip);
*>   EF9-TRIDENT-CULL OUT(1 the box inflation, 1.5), EF9-TRIDENT-TEXTURE IN(1 foil) path(out X(60)) and OUT(1 the render type 1 entitySolid, 2 entitySolidGlint);
*>   EF9-SPIN-ANIM USING model, IN(1 ageInTicks): 5.3 setupAnim (box i: yRot = wrapDegrees(age x -(45 + (i + 1) x 5)) x D);
*>   EF9-WIND-ANIM USING model, IN(1 ageInTicks): 6.1 setupAnim (wind_charge.yRot = -age x 16 D, wind.yRot = +age x 16 D, assigned);
*>   EF9-WIND-SCROLL IN(1 ageInTicks) OUT(1 the texture offset u = (age x 0.03) mod 1, 6.2).

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF9-M-TRIDENT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS1.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P pole root 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C pole 0 6 -0.5 2 -0.5 1 25 1 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P base pole 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C base 4 0 -1.5 0 -0.5 3 2 1 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P left_spike pole 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C left_spike 4 3 -2.5 -3 -0.5 1 4 1 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P middle_spike pole 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C middle_spike 0 0 -0.5 -4 -0.5 1 4 1 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P right_spike pole 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C right_spike 4 3 1.5 -3 -0.5 1 4 1 0 1".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES OCCURS 70 TIMES.
 01 WS-ROWS1-R REDEFINES WS-ROWS1.
    05 WS-ROW1             PIC X(100) OCCURS 80 TIMES.
 01 WS-N1                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 10.
 01 WS-ZERO                FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL.
     CALL "EMM-INIT" USING EMM-MODEL
     CALL "EM3-ROWS" USING EMM-MODEL WS-ROWS1-R WS-N1 WS-ZERO
     MOVE 32 TO MM-TEXW
     MOVE 32 TO MM-TEXH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF9-M-TRIDENT.

