 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF9-TRIDENT-OPS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 32 TIMES.
 01 L-OUT.
    05 L-O                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-IN L-OUT.
     MOVE 2 TO L-O(1)
     MOVE 3 TO L-O(2)
     COMPUTE L-O(3) = L-I(1) - 90
     MOVE 0 TO L-O(4) L-O(5)
     MOVE 7 TO L-O(6)
     COMPUTE L-O(7) = L-I(2) + 90
     MOVE 0 TO L-O(8) L-O(9)
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF9-TRIDENT-OPS.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
